{"title":"Tavares Strachan","link":"https://kottke.org/25/03/tavares-strachan","date":1743019340000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1312\" alt=\"a collage by Tavares Strachan\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1294\" alt=\"a collage by Tavares Strachan\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/tavares-strachan-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"1310\" alt=\"a collage by Tavares Strachan\" /></p>\n\n<p>I like these collage-like artworks by <a href=\"https://isolatedlabs.com/\">Tavares Strachan</a>. One of the figures depicted above in the third piece, just above the queen, is polar explorer <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matthew_Henson\">Matthew Henson</a>, who was <a href=\"https://www.nationalgeographic.com/adventure/article/the-legacy-of-arctic-explorer-matthew-henson\">the first person</a> (<a href=\"https://time.com/6294794/robert-peary-frederick-cook-north-pole-feud/\">maybe?</a>) to reach the geographic North Pole in 1909 as part of Robert Peary’s expedition.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/art\">art</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Matthew%20Henson\">Matthew Henson</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Robert%20Peary\">Robert Peary</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Tavares%20Strachan\">Tavares Strachan</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/03/tavares-strachan\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"0352c54b94e0e7315799385c291a1bfe33dc946d031ae895951bc61aa9eb8c87","category":"Sites"}